; The configuration schema of the test tuner module (CONFIG §2; DECISIONS I87):
; a supporting schema, resolved against itself and the common schema only.
; `pad` lets a test make a value of any size up to the 8 MiB limit.

tuner.config = {
  station: tuner.station,
  volume: uint32,
  ? presets: [* tuner.station],
  ? pad: bstr,
}

tuner.station = tstr .size (1..64)
